    "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307300/extras/0642fc7fce18223a0dac0ad776503159.webp?t=1752717598\" /></span><br>Kurone's Feelings \uff5eApprentice Witch of Starfall Village\uff5e<br>follows a girl who has lost her memories as she gradually develops <br>human &quot;feelings&quot; and stumbles through various mishaps while doing her best <br>to assist the witch of a small village in helping the locals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307300/extras/eefcb7b16e249724e41cd775aa92060a.avif?t=1752717598\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307300/extras/63229618f5896358badd5cff2cb4e2e4.avif?t=1752717598\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307300/extras/988a4aff11e4d06fc8091ce64493e363.webp?t=1752717598\" /></span><br>-Cuteness prevails!<br>Kurone's various misadventures will never ruin her cheer.<br><br>-Lots of costumes!<br>Some requests will have Kurone change her outfit, <br>and the nice Kurone will never refuse a person in need.<br><br>-Go out and explore!<br>Explore the village and search for people in need.<br>As you help them, Kurone's fame will grow, earning her even more requests.<br><br>-Stats and feedback!<br>Kurone's progress is recorded in detail, and while she's sleeping,<br>you can take a peek into the villagers' thoughts about her.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307300/extras/0642fc7fce18223a0dac0ad776503159.webp?t=1752717598\" /></span><br>Kurone's Feelings \uff5eApprentice Witch of Starfall Village\uff5e<br>follows a girl who has lost her memories as she gradually develops <br>human &quot;feelings&quot; and stumbles through various mishaps while doing her best <br>to assist the witch of a small village in helping the locals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307300/extras/eefcb7b16e249724e41cd775aa92060a.avif?t=1752717598\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307300/extras/63229618f5896358badd5cff2cb4e2e4.avif?t=1752717598\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2307300/extras/988a4aff11e4d06fc8091ce64493e363.webp?t=1752717598\" /></span><br>-Cuteness prevails!<br>Kurone's various misadventures will never ruin her cheer.<br><br>-Lots of costumes!<br>Some requests will have Kurone change her outfit, <br>and the nice Kurone will never refuse a person in need.<br><br>-Go out and explore!<br>Explore the village and search for people in need.<br>As you help them, Kurone's fame will grow, earning her even more requests.<br><br>-Stats and feedback!<br>Kurone's progress is recorded in detail, and while she's sleeping,<br>you can take a peek into the villagers' thoughts about her.",
